        "notes": "now the fun can begin.\n\ntime to buy  [Battle Medic](item_ccd0edff-4d57-4ac2-83a7-bab6ff0ffb2f)! \n\n [Triage Unit](item_fec0554c-2685-4b93-822d-bf0020e654b4) is also a good pick this round if your team is dying too much, or otherwise can't build towards attack speed as desired. \n\nthis is usually the round i buy  [Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48) because it's gonna stay with us for the rest of the build. but if i'm dissatisfied with my healing output, i'll buy  [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124) instead and use the rest of my money on rare powers that boost attack speed.\n\ni'm gonna be honest with you, my red flag is not putting anything towards survival. in fact, this build pretty much ignores that entire branch of powers. but if i'm being hard focused and my team isn't able to help me as much as i need, i will sacrifice weapon power for it.  [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0) is my go-to for round 3 if needed.\n\nif you're rolling in dough, any of the optional powers are acceptable. follow your heart.",
