        "notes": "[Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48),  [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124), and  [Commander's Clip](item_ff7cad01-2065-4908-a2c1-3bdf1458c7a4) are pretty important to the builds entire purpose. so mix and match mindfully. remember, attack speed is what we're building towards. if you can, try to get  [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce) too. it's also pretty important, but it's not always necessary.\n\nlike i said in previous rounds, if you're having trouble staying alive or getting away, it's perfectly okay to give up weapon power for survivability. [Three-tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429) is a good combo with  [Angelic Acrobatics](item_baad85fc-3da5-43af-ad9d-f17885f59aa5) if you kept that, which is totally acceptable and doesn't really hurt the build. though if i'm going that route, i might buy  [Caduceus Ex](item_9e7965ea-2abc-44a7-b042-950c6ad2fce7) to go along with it.\n\n [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124) may also be switched with any of the optional powers if you think your team really can survive without that extra healing burst. i'd recommend  [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) or  [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce) in its place.",
